<p>Slaving for many years at the forge has made you more resilient to physical pain and fire burns.</p><p>Your fire resistance is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 9%, 14%, 18%, 22%</acronym> and your physical resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 7%, 11%, 14%, 17%.</acronym></p><p>At talent level 5, you are so accustomed to the flames that you become immune to the fireburn effect.</p>